e, break single, break chunk\n- save block builds locally\n- publish you locally saved block builds\n- like and download other peoples' builds\n\nFeatures\n- notifications for public rooms\n- save settings like lights and pinch pull\n- change the way you open menus\n- other peoples hands now disappear when they lose tracking\n- fade hand when menu is open\n- added an Easter egg\n- structures now freeze while attaching block\n\nDe-Jank\n- controllers don't get stuck in your face\n- block are less likely to freak out\n- user teleport is instant when you change layout\n- blocks no longer get stuck flying away\n- more error messages when things go wrong\n- hands less likely to get stuck in table\n- objects reset velocity when they reset teleport\n- prevent interacting with blocks when menu open\n- screen no long deletes itself sometimes", "created_date": 1623256256, "id": "2629830857140716", "version": "0.2.0", "version_code": 56, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2311379172319221", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2646338145489987"}, "release_status": "SCHEDULED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1622826085, "id": "2617522665038202", "version": "0.1.6", "version_code": 55, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2311379172319221", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_bin